cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the repository and the accompanying manuscript."
title: "Generate-then-Verify"
abstract: >-
  A training-free, evidence-grounded framework for trustworthy vision-language
  reasoning in safety-critical applications. VLM-generated risk descriptions
  are treated as preliminary hypotheses and verified against independent
  visual evidence extracted by a multi-expert computer vision engine with
  spatial-geometric reasoning, complemented by rule-conditioned verification
  and a human-in-the-loop auditing interface.
type: software
